se and implement a fix.\n4. **Verify the Fix**: Rerun the script to ensure the error is resolved.\n\nLet's start by creating the reproduction script.\n<|tool_call|>{\"name\": \"write_file\", \"arguments\": {\"path\": \"/workspace/python__mypy__0.820/reproduce_error.py\", \"content\": \"\\n# mypy: no-strict-optional, strict-equality\\n\\nfrom typing import Any, Optional\\n\\nx: Optional[Any]\\n\\nif x in (1, 2):  # Error: non-overlapping container check\\n    pass\\n\\n\"}}<|tool_call_end|>"}, {"role": "user", "content": "EXECUTION RESULT of [str_replace_editor]:\nFile created successfully at: /workspace/python__mypy__0.820/reproduce_error.py"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<|tool_call|>{\"name\": \"run_command\", \"arguments\": {\"command\": \"python /workspace/python__mypy__0.820/reproduce_error.py\"}}<|tool_call_end|>"}, {"role": "user", "content": "EXECUTION RESULT of [execute_bash]:\npython /workspace/python__mypy__0.820/reproduce_error.py\r\nTraceback (most recent call last):\r\n  File \"/workspace/python__mypy__0.820/reproduce_error.py\", line 7, in <module>\r\n    if x in (1, 2):  # Error: non-overlapping container check\r\nNameError: name 'x' is not defined[Python Interpreter: /opt/miniconda3/envs/testbed/bin/python]\nroot@openhands-workspace:/workspace/python__mypy__0.820 # \n[Command finished with exit code 1]"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "The script failed to run because the variable `x` is not initialized. This is expected since the script is meant to be type-checked by mypy, not executed directly by Python. We need to run this script using mypy to reproduce the type-checking error.\n\nLet's run the script using mypy to see the error message.\n<|tool_call|>{\"name\": \"run_command\", \"arguments\": {\"command\": \"mypy --config-file mypy.ini /workspace/python__mypy__0.820/reproduce_error.py\"}}<|tool_call_end|>"}, {"role": "user", "content": "EXECUTION RESULT of [execute_bash]:\nmypy --config-file mypy.ini /workspace/python__mypy__0.820/repro