: "assistant", "content": "I'll localize with the graph tools first, starting from the symbols named in the issue.\n<|tool_call|>{\"name\": \"search_similar_code\", \"arguments\": {\"symbol\": \"stop\"}}<|tool_call_end|>"}, {"role": "user", "content": "{\n \"symbol\": \"stop\",\n \"matches\": [\n  {\n   \"file\": \"rich/live.py\",\n   \"line\": 31,\n   \"kind\": \"definition\"\n  }\n ]\n}"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "stop is defined in rich/live.py. Checking its callers and callees before reading any file.\n<|tool_call|>{\"name\": \"get_code_neighbors\", \"arguments\": {\"symbol\": \"stop\"}}<|tool_call_end|>"}, {"role": "user", "content": "{\n \"symbol\": \"stop\",\n \"callers\": [\n  \"__init__\",\n  \"last_render_height\",\n  \"set_renderable\"\n ],\n \"callees\": [\n  \"__init__\",\n  \"last_render_height\",\n  \"set_renderable\"\n ],\n \"note\": \"neighbors derived from symbols co-occurring in the patch\"\n}"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Getting the surrounding call graph so I read only the files that matter.\n<|tool_call|>{\"name\": \"get_code_subgraph\", \"arguments\": {\"symbol\": \"stop\"}}<|tool_call_end|>"}, {"role": "user", "content": "{\n \"nodes\": [\n  {\n   \"symbol\": \"stop\",\n   \"file\": \"rich/live.py\",\n   \"line\": 31\n  },\n  {\n   \"symbol\": \"__init__\",\n   \"file\": \"rich/live.py\",\n   \"line\": 25\n  },\n  {\n   \"symbol\": \"last_render_height\",\n   \"file\": \"rich/live.py\",\n   \"line\": 166\n  },\n  {\n   \"symbol\": \"set_renderable\",\n   \"file\": \"rich/live_render.py\",\n   \"line\": 33\n  }\n ],\n \"edges\": [\n  [\n   \"stop\",\n   \"__init__\"\n  ],\n  [\n   \"stop\",\n   \"last_render_height\"\n  ],\n  [\n   \"stop\",\n   \"set_renderable\"\n  ]\n ],\n \"files\": [\n  \"rich/live.py\",\n  \"rich/live_render.py\"\n ]\n}"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Reading rich/live.py around the suspect symbol.\n<|tool_call|>{\"name\": \"read_file\", \"arguments\": {\"path\": \"rich/live.py\"}}<|tool_call_end|>"