 {"role": "assistant", "content": "The script executed successfully, but it seems that the current implementation does not raise an error when the test data is already in the form of a list of dictionaries. Instead, it incorrectly wraps each dictionary in another dictionary with the key `\"image\"`. This is not the desired behavior.\n\n### Plan to Fix the Issue\n\n1. **Modify the `load_decathlon_datalist` function**:\n   - When the `data_list_key` is `\"test\"`, check if the first element of the list is a dictionary.\n   - If it is a dictionary, assume the data is already in the correct format and do not modify it.\n   - If it is not a dictionary, convert the list of filenames to a list of dictionaries as currently done.\n\nLet's implement these changes in the `decathlon_datalist.py` file.\n<|tool_call|>{\"name\": \"edit_file\", \"arguments\": {\"path\": \"/workspace/Project-MONAI__MONAI__0.8/monai/data/decathlon_datalist.py\", \"old_text\": \"\\n    if data_list_key == \\\"test\\\":\\n        expected_data = [{\\\"image\\\": i} for i in expected_data]\\n\", \"new_text\": \"\\n    if data_list_key == \\\"test\\\":\\n        # Check if the first element is a dictionary\\n        if expected_data and isinstance(expected_data[0], dict):\\n            # Assume the data is already in the correct format\\n            pass\\n        else:\\n            # Convert list of filenames to list of dictionaries\\n            expected_data = [{\\\"image\\\": i} for i in expected_data]\\n\"}}<|tool_call_end|>"}, {"role": "user", "content": "EXECUTION RESULT of [str_replace_editor]:\nThe file /workspace/Project-MONAI__MONAI__0.8/monai/data/decathlon_datalist.py has been edited. Here's the result of running `cat -n` on a snippet of /workspace/Project-MONAI__MONAI__0.8/monai/data/decathlon_datalist.py:\n   121\t        json_data = json.load(json_file)\n   122\t    if data_list_key not in json_data:\n   123\t        raise ValueError(f'Data list {data_list_key} not specified in \"{data_list_file_path}\".')\n   124\t    expected_data = json_data[data_list_key]\n   125\t    if data_list_key == \"test\":\n   126\t        # Check if the first element is a dictionary\n   127\t        if expected_data and isinstance(expected_data[0], dict):\n   128\t            # Assume the data is already in the correct format\n   129\t            pass\n   130\t        else:\n   131\t            # Convert list of filenames to list of dictionaries\n   132\t            expected_data = [{\"image\": i} for i in expected_data]\n   133\t\n   134\t    if base_dir is None:\n   135\t        base_dir = data_list_file_path.parent\n   136\t\nReview the changes and make sure they are as expected. Edit the file again if necessary."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<|tool_call|>{\"name\": \"run_command\", \"arguments\": {\"command\": \"python /workspace/Project-MONAI__MONAI__0.8/reproduce_error.py\"}}<|tool_call_end|>"}, {"role": "user", "content": "EXECUTION RESULT of [execute_bash]:\npython /workspace/Project-MONAI__MONAI__0.8/reproduce_error.py\r\nData list loaded successfully: [{'image': '/workspace/data/chest_19.nii.gz', 'othermetafield': 0}, {'image': '/workspace/data/chest_31.nii.gz', 'othermetafield': 1}][Python Interpreter: /opt/miniconda3/envs/testbed/bin/python]\nroot@openhands-workspace:/workspace/Project-MONAI__MONAI__0.8 # \n[Command finished with exit code 0]"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<|tool_call|>{\"name\": \"submit_patch\", \"arguments\": {}}<|tool_call_end|>"}], "metadata": {"source": "swegym-sft", "instance_id": "unknown", "traj_turn": 9, "tool": "submit_patch", "est_tokens": 1742}}
