1140 with the comment by @Viicos fixed by vendoring a copy of `is_typealiastype` from [`typing-inspection`](https://github.com/pydantic/typing-inspection)."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I'll localize with the graph tools first, starting from the symbols named in the issue.\n<|tool_call|>{\"name\": \"search_similar_code\", \"arguments\": {\"symbol\": \"analyze_param\"}}<|tool_call_end|>"}, {"role": "user", "content": "{\n \"symbol\": \"analyze_param\",\n \"matches\": [\n  {\n   \"file\": \"fastapi/dependencies/utils.py\",\n   \"line\": 362,\n   \"kind\": \"definition\"\n  }\n ]\n}"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "analyze_param is defined in fastapi/dependencies/utils.py. Checking its callers and callees before reading any file.\n<|tool_call|>{\"name\": \"get_code_neighbors\", \"arguments\": {\"symbol\": \"analyze_param\"}}<|tool_call_end|>"}, {"role": "user", "content": "{\n \"symbol\": \"analyze_param\",\n \"callers\": [\n  \"is_typealiastype\"\n ],\n \"callees\": [\n  \"is_typealiastype\"\n ],\n \"note\": \"neighbors derived from symbols co-occurring in the patch\"\n}"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Getting the surrounding call graph so I read only the files that matter.\n<|tool_call|>{\"name\": \"get_code_subgraph\", \"arguments\": {\"symbol\": \"analyze_param\"}}<|tool_call_end|>"}, {"role": "user", "content": "{\n \"nodes\": [\n  {\n   \"symbol\": \"analyze_param\",\n   \"file\": \"fastapi/dependencies/utils.py\",\n   \"line\": 362\n  },\n  {\n   \"symbol\": \"is_typealiastype\",\n   \"file\": \"fastapi/dependencies/utils.py\",\n   \"line\": 66\n  }\n ],\n \"edges\": [\n  [\n   \"analyze_param\",\n   \"is_typealiastype\"\n  ]\n ],\n \"files\": [\n  \"fastapi/dependencies/utils.py\"\n ]\n}"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Reading fastapi/dependencies/utils.py around the suspect symbol.\n<|tool_call|>{\"name\": \"read_file\", \"arguments\": {\"path\": \"fastapi/dependencies/utils.py\"}}<|tool_call_end|>"}], "metadata": {"source": "programmatic"